            "==Short access-token TTL==: 5 min means a **5-minute** worst case",
            "No lookup, no list, no hop — expiry does the work for free",
            "Cost: a refresh round-trip every 5 min per active client",
            "OIDC __backchannel logout__: AS POSTs a `logout_token` to each RP"
