          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "**Client-side logout only**: `localStorage.clear()` — the server still honors the token",
            "Denylist with no TTL: Redis grows forever, nothing ever prunes it",
            "Introspecting on every request with no cache: the AS is now your bottleneck",
            "30-day access tokens 'because refresh is annoying' — revocation is now impossible",
            "Front-channel logout as the only path: third-party cookie blocking kills it silently"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
